  "interpretation_limits": [
    "The new classifier is the census outer-shape predicate, not the full strict-DER validity predicate in interpreter.rs.",
    "Zero nonshape attempts excludes filter-rejected observed helper attempts in this sample; it does not establish strict-DER compliance or exclude all lax-parser acceptance.",
    "Global item and attempt totals do not identify unique executed item occurrences or retry callsites. They do not prove exactly 2442 CHECKMULTISIG retries; unused pushes and other signature sources or repeated script operations require provenance to reconcile.",
    "Attempts greater than or equal to structural pushed items is not a universal invariant: some items may not be executed.",
    "Regression stdout records immature replay rc=1 and zero-worker PASS; the latter does not record its exact rc. Existing test source checks any nonzero status and can skip when binary absent.",
    "SINGLE accounting is per matching witness DER-shaped item at an input index; it remains a structural execution-cost model."
  ]
